core/src/derec/stores.js adapts the in-memory stores of the DeRec Alliance smoke tests
(lib-derec v0.1.0, smoke-tests/nodejs/protocol.ts, Apache-2.0, Copyright (c) 2026 DeRec Alliance),
replacing memory with a persistent key-value store. The app uses the DeRec SDK packages
@derec-alliance/react-native and @derec-alliance/nodejs (Apache-2.0).

core/src/swapv3.js reimplements in JavaScript the concentrated-liquidity maths of Uniswap v3
(TickMath, SqrtPriceMath, SwapMath, TickBitmap) to quote SaucerSwap V2 pools.

